Package: dagml
Title: R Binding for DAG-ML Local Implementations
Version: 0.3.30
Authors@R: person("Gregory", "Beurier", email = "gregory.beurier@cirad.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides R bindings for native DAG-ML phase execution, host
    hyperparameter search, cross-validation, refit, prediction and bundle
    replay through process adapters. R loss and metric functions are retained
    in process-local registries keyed by validated implementation descriptors;
    executable functions are never serialized into graph contracts.
License: CeCILL-2.1 | AGPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/GBeurier/dag-ml
BugReports: https://github.com/GBeurier/dag-ml/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: jsonlite
SystemRequirements: DAG-ML C ABI shared library for task-bound loss invocation
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
